---
title: "getRoundDetails (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: GET /v1/integration/rounds/id
    q_receive --> q_auth: validate JWT token
    q_auth --> q_unauthorized: token invalid
    q_unauthorized --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_auth --> q_lookup: token valid
    q_lookup --> q_not_found: round id not found
    q_not_found --> [*]: return 404 not found
    q_lookup --> q_return: round exists
    q_return --> [*]: return round details

    note right of q_lookup
        INV-001: round id must reference an existing round
        INV-002: returned details must be comprehensive (all round metadata)
    end note
